Package: femme
Title: Fixed-Effects Marginal Means Estimation
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: 
    c(person("Joop", "Adema", email = "joop.adema@uibk.ac.at", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Lasha", "Chargaziia", email = "chargaziia@ifo.de", role = c("aut")))
Description: A set of useful tools and wrappers for analysing conjoint survey experiments.
    Key features include (1) Estimation of Average Marginal Component Effects (AMCEs)
    and Marginal Means (MMs) with individual fixed effects, (2) stratified
    bootstrap confidence intervals and two-sided p-values, (3) subgroup analyses
    (within-group and cross-group pairwise comparisons with inference), and (4) 
    attribute-based predictions (optionally with LASSO-based interaction selection).
    The package relies on 'fixest' for fast within-respondent estimation.
